    "finalName": "",
    "description": "When you make a successful <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Persuasion\" title=\"Persuasion\">Persuasion</a> check, you can immediately make a second <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Persuasion\" title=\"Persuasion\">Persuasion</a> check against the same target, even if it is not normally allowed. The second <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Persuasion\" title=\"Persuasion\">Persuasion</a> check need not be for the same use of the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Persuasion\" title=\"Persuasion\">Persuasion</a> skill as the first. For example, if you successfully <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Change_Attitude\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Change Attitude\">Change Attitude</a> of the target, you can immediately attempt to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Change_Attitude\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Change Attitude\">Change Attitude</a> a second time, or you can attempt to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Intimidate\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Intimidate\">Intimidate</a> the target instead.",
